  "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Just when you thought the perfect gift didn&rsquo;t exist, CanvasGift&rsquo;s handmade personalized gift shop arrived! Born during the pandemic, we&rsquo;re grateful to be here four years later, still sharing what we love. Our mission is to be the go-to place for celebrating family, love, friendship, and connection.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Product Description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">We specialize in handmade, personalized gifts crafted to order. Our best-sellers include family gifts for moms and grandmas, and we&rsquo;re proud to maintain a conversion rate above the industry average, thanks to our exceptional product selection.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Unique Selling Point:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Personalized, handmade gifts with heart.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Payment Terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Payments are processed once a month during the first week, covering the previous month&rsquo;s affiliate sales. Our preferred method is bank transfer, but we&rsquo;re happy to discuss alternative options if needed.</span></p>",
